category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libstdc++6
sdesc: "C++ library and command-line utility for reading GDSII geometry files (runtime)"
ldesc: "libGDSII is a C++ library for working with GDSII binary data files, intended
primarily for use with the computational electromagnetism codes scuff-em and
meep but sufficiently general-purpose to allow other uses as well."
external-source: libGDSII

